<title>USA: First United Bancshares Q1 shr up.</title>
<headline>First United Bancshares Q1 shr up.</headline>
<dateline>EL DORADO, Ark. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.59		    $0.58</p>
<p> Net		 4,800		    4,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total assets at the end of period were $1.56 billion, an  increase of approximately six percent from $1.47 billion at March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>Total deposits at March 31, 1997 were $1.32 billion, while total loans for the same period were $731 million.</p>
